Exact Answer: Movies released before 2022 where a character is based on a real person under age 15 include:
- The Miracle Worker (1962) – Helen Keller, about age 6
- The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind (2019) – William Kamkwamba, age 13
- Queen of Katwe (2016) – Phiona Mutesi, age 10
- Lion (2016) – young Saroo Brierley, age 5

