    "snippet": "---\ntitle: William Kamkwamba, author, \"The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind,\" and Malawi Windmill Maker\ndate: 2008-02-17\n---\nI am working on a book about my life with Bryan Mealer, an incredibly talented writer who recently published a book about the civil war in the Democratic Republic of Congo. Here he sits in my home with Gilbert Wimbe, my best friend. The book will be published next year from an American publisher called William Morrow, which is an imprint of HarperCollins. Bryan came to visit me to work on the book proposal, and then he plans to come back and spend a month in Malawi in June/July."
