legant animated offerings.\n\nSynopsis: An arrogant young prince and his castle's servants fall under the spell of a wicked enchantress, who turns him into [More]\n\n#49\n\nCritics Consensus: Chicken Run has all the charm of Nick Park's Wallace & Gromit, and something for everybody. The voice acting is fabulous, the"
