will love the childhood throwback.\n\nAvailable on: Amazon Prime, Apple TV, DirecTV and Vudu\n\nReleased: 1993\n\nRated: PG\n\nMemorable Quote: \"You're killing me, Smalls!\"\n\nThe Sandlot takes place in the summer of 1962 and follows a group of young friends who spend their days playing baseball and getting into shenan"
